1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,529
The first clinic searches an MRN that
belongs to another clinic.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,571
The record does not exist here: zero
matching patient records.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,214
The same search inside her own clinic
returns her.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,214
Platform oversight opens the clinic as a
read-only view.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,571
Isolation is enforced in the database, not
in the interface.
